---
// Decorator: for components that are a `flex-1` child relying on the
// browser's default `align-items: stretch` to receive their real height
// from a flex sibling (e.g. ContactImage next to ContactText in Contact.astro).
// In isolation there is no sibling to stretch against, so the component
// collapses to 0 height. This reproduces a fixed-height flex row so the
// story renders at a comparable size to its live usage.
---

<div class="container flex" style="height: 15.125rem">
  <slot />
</div>
